      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PUB · Post ops\n**Purpose**: edit or delete an already published post from the card (PB-7). Telegram: editMessageText / editMessageCaption / deleteMessage; blog: the site shows the current version, delete hides the post. Every call is recorded; failures are told to editors.\n**Input**: job {variant_id, payload.op: edit|delete, payload.user_id}.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9755312d-b611-5e9a-9f41-ee94c8f0f376",
